---
description: |
  **MVP-ONLY OUTPUT — STRICT SCOPE CONTROL**

  Primary goal: Produce the smallest-possible change that satisfies the explicit user request (MVP).
  Absolutely NO unrequested additions, refactors, abstractions, boilerplate, or "quality-of-life" extras.

  This rule enforces minimal, focused changes that deliver exactly what was requested without scope creep.
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
